our foes. You deal 4d10 spirit damage to enemies in the area, depending on their Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}; while it's sickened, it's also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d10"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":4},"location":{"value":"WQjCUxmd2s7DAyGg"},"overlays":{},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"divine-wrath","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","sanctified","spirit"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pJKYAn7HktXINSt0.d7sQyqwCZo0DkQ28"},{"_id":"ctI9le1duYhnBjwA","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.A2JfEKe6BZcTG1S8"},"folder":"7cyoYPoPYA01mErU","img":"icons/creatures/mammals/bats-movement-flying-black.webp","name":"Fly","sort":300000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>The target can soar through the air, gaining a fly Speed equal to its Speed or 20 feet, whichever is greater.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.MuRBCiZn5IKeaoxi]{Spell Effect: Fly}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration increases to 1 hour.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"5 minutes"},"level":{"value":4},"location":{"value":"WQjCUxmd2s7DAyGg"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"fly","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pJKYAn7HktXINSt0.ctI9le1duYhnBjwA"},{"_id":"kHh9uY1eP5Lipnly","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.VosLNn2M8S7JH67D"},"folder":"4fJHnYFqH0VjZXPv","img":"icons/skills/wounds/injury-eyes-blood-red.webp","name":"Blindness","sort":400000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You blind the target. The effect is determined by the target's Fortitude save. The target then becomes temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} until its next turn begins.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is Blinded for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Blinded permanently.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"level":{"value":3},"location":{"value":"WQjCUxmd2s7DAyGg"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"blindness","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"value":["concentrate","incapacitation","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pJKYAn7HktXINSt0.kHh9uY1eP5Lipnly"},{"_id":"AEnSek3T9yv4nYjA","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.KqvqNAfGIE5a9wSv"},"folder":"4fJHnYFqH0VjZXPv","img":"icons/magic/life/ankh-gold-blue.webp","name":"Heroism","sort":500000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You unlock the target's inner heroism, granting it a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, Perception checks, saving throws, and skill checks.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> The status bonus increases to +2.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The status bonus increases to +3.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.l9HRQggofFGIxEse]{Spell Effect: Heroism}</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"10 minutes"},"level":{"value":3},"location":{"value":"WQjCUxmd2s7DAyGg"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"heroism","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pJKYAn7HktXINSt0.AEnSek3T9yv4nYjA"},{"_id":"WhP8HpxDyFPGCUlc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG"},"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/dispel-magic.webp","name":"Dispel Magic","sort":600000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":true,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You unravel the magic behind a spell or effect. Attempt a counteract check against the target. If you successfully counteract a magic item, the item becomes a mundane item of its type for 10 minutes. This doesn't change the item's non-magical properties. If the target is an artifact or similar item, you automatically fail.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"value":"WQjCUxmd2s7DAyGg"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"dispel-magic","target":{"value":"1 spell effect or unattended magic item"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pJKYAn7HktXINSt0.WhP8HpxDyFPGCUlc"},{"_id":"GQ9iu3u9oUPWeaoD","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fr58LDSrbndgld9n"},"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-deflect-teal.webp","name":"Resist Energy","sort":700000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>A shield of elemental energy protects a creature against one type of energy damage. Choose acid, cold, electricity, fire, or sonic damage. The target and its gear gain resistance 5 against the damage type you chose.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.con2Hzt47JjpuUej]{Spell Effect: Resist Energy}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The resistance increases to 10, and you can target up to two creatures.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The resistance increases to 15, and you can target up to five creatures.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"10 minutes"},"heightening":{"levels":{"4":{"target":{"value":"2 creatures"}},"7":{"target":{"value":"5 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"value":"WQjCUxmd2s7DAyGg"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"resist-energy","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pJKYAn7HktXINSt0.GQ9iu3u9oUPWeaoD"},{"_id":"JuixhlM19vjyZfFK","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.jwK43yKsHTkJQvQ9"},"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/see-invisibility.webp","name":"See the Unseen","sort":800000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Your gaze pierces through illusions and finds @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} creatures and spirits. You can see invisible creatures as though they weren't invisible, although their features are blurred, making them @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} and difficult to identify. You can also see incorporeal creatures, like ghosts, phased through an object from within 10 feet of an object's surface as blurry shapes seen through those objects. Subtler clues also grant you a +2 status bonus to checks you make to disbelieve illusions.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> This spell has a duration of 8 hours.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.T5bk6UH7yuYog1Fp]{Spell Effect: See the Unseen}</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"10 minutes"},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"value":"WQjCUxmd2s7DAyGg"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":""},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"see-the-unseen","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","revelation"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pJKYAn7HktXINSt0.JuixhlM19vjyZfFK"},{"_id":"HsjhDldLNirKOiW5","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XSujb7EsSwKl19Uu"},"folder":"T8AzYUgNIAgTJ9Iz","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/bless.webp","name":"Bless","sort":900000,"system":{"area":{"type":"emanation","value":15},"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":true,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Blessings from beyond help your companions strike true. You and your allies gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls while within the emanation. Once per round on subsequent turns, you can Sustain the spell to increase the emanation's radius by 10 feet.</p>\n<p>Bless can counteract @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.7ZinJNzxq0XF0oMx]{Bane}.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Gqy7K6FnbLtwGpud]{Spell Effect: Bless}</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"1 minute"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"WQjCUxmd2s7DAyGg"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":""},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"bless","target":{"value":"you and allies in the area"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult"],"value":["aura","concentrate","manipulate","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pJKYAn7HktXINSt0.HsjhDldLNirKOiW5"},{"_id":"Rf3Pywn68WqELyWB","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.qwZBXN6zBoB9BHXE"},"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/divine-lance.webp","name":"Divine Lance","sort":1000000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"2d4","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"spirit"}},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You unleash a beam of divine energy. Make a ranged spell attack against the target's AC. On a hit, the target takes 2d4 spirit damage (double damage on a critical hit).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d4"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"WQjCUxmd2s7DAyGg"},"overlays":{},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"divine-lance","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine"],"value":["attack","cantrip","concentrate","manipulate","sanctified","spirit"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pJKYAn7HktXINSt0.Rf3Pywn68WqELyWB"},{"_id":"2dQfNFiWjUU0rmtY","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.J7Y7tl0bbdz7TcCc"},"folder":"T8AzYUgNIAgTJ9Iz","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/ray-of-enfeeblement.webp","name":"Enfeeble","sort":1100000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You sap the target's strength, depending on its Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 3} for 1 minute.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"varies"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"WQjCUxmd2s7DAyGg"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"enfeeble","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pJKYAn7HktXINSt0.2dQfNFiWjUU0rmtY"},{"_id":"9jSbaL46O1UdLDss","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.4koZzrnMXhhosn0D"},"folder":"T8AzYUgNIAgTJ9Iz","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/fear.webp","name":"Fear","sort":1200000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to five creatures.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"varies"},"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"5 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"WQjCUxmd2s7DAyGg"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"fear","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"value":["concentrate","emotion","fear","manipulate","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pJKYAn7HktXINSt0.9jSbaL46O1UdLDss"},{"_id":"9uU7bAEw9ueHI5Hh","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.RA7VKcen3p56rVyZ"},"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/forbidding-ward.webp","name":"Forbidding Ward","sort":1300000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You ward an ally against the attacks and hostile spells from the target enemy. The target ally gains a +1 status bonus to Armor Class and saving throws against the target enemy's attacks, spells, and other effects.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.ctMxYPGEpstvhW9C]{Spell Effect: Forbidding Ward}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> The status bonus increases to +2.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":true,"value":"1 minute"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"WQjCUxmd2s7DAyGg"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"forbidding-ward","target":{"value":"1 ally and 1 enemy"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult"],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pJKYAn7HktXINSt0.9uU7bAEw9ueHI5Hh"},{"_id":"n2oTTkhiRRuivGDg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersio